    {
      "source": "Performs the given action for each element of the <a href=\"../util/Streamable.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.util\"><code>Streamable</code></a> recursively until all elements of the graph\nhave been processed or the action throws an <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Exception.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>Exception</code></a>.",
      "translation": "对<a href=\"../util/Streamable.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.util\"><code>Streamable</code></a>的每个元素递归执行给定操作，直到处理完图中的所有元素或该操作抛出<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Exception.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>Exception</code></a>。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Performs the given action for each element of the <a href=\"../util/Streamable.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.util\"><code>Streamable</code></a> recursively until all elements of the graph\nhave been processed or the action throws an <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Exception.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>Exception</code></a>. Unless otherwise specified by the implementing\nclass, actions are performed in the order of iteration (if an iteration order is specified). Exceptions thrown by\nthe action are relayed to the caller.",
      "translation": "对 <a href=\"../util/Streamable.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.util\"><code>Streamable</code></a> 中的每个元素递归执行给定操作，直到处理完图中的所有元素或该操作抛出 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Exception.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>Exception</code></a>。除非实现类另有规定，否则操作将按照迭代顺序（如果指定了迭代顺序）执行。由该操作抛出的异常将传递给调用者。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<h1 class=\"title\" title=\"Class EntityProjection\">Class EntityProjection&lt;M,<wbr/>D&gt;</h1>",
