    {
      "source": "Descriptor for a top-level mapped type representing a view onto a domain type structure. The view may exactly match\nthe domain type or be a DTO/interface <a href=\"#isProjection()\"><code>projection</code></a>.",
      "translation": "描述符，用于表示对域类型结构视图的顶层映射类型。该视图可能与域类型完全匹配，也可能是一个 DTO/接口<a href=\"#isProjection()\"><code>projection</code></a>（投影）。",
      "count": 1
    },
